{
  "rules": [
    {
      "text": "HEY!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S THE HUMAN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'RE GONNA\nLOVE THIS\nPUZZLE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT WAS MADE\nBY THE GREAT\nDR. ALPHYS!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU SEE\nTHESE TILES\n!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ONCE I THROW\nTHIS SWITCH...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY WILL\nBEGIN TO\nCHANGE COLOR!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "EACH COLOR HAS\nA DIFFERENT\nFUNCTION!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "RED TILES ARE\nIMPASSABLE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU CANNOT\nWALK ON THEM!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YELLOW TILES\nARE ELECTRIC!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY WILL\nELECTROCUTE\nYOU!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "GREEN TILES\nARE ALARM\nTILES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IF YOU STEP\nON THEM...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU WILL HAVE\nTO FIGHT A\nMONSTER!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ORANGE TILES\nARE ORANGE-\nSCENTED.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY WILL MAKE\nYOU SMELL\nDELICIOUS!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BLUE TILES ARE\nWATER TILES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SWIM THROUGH\nIF YOU LIKE,\nBUT...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IF YOU SMELL\nLIKE ORANGES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PIRANHAS\nWILL BITE\nYOU.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ALSO, IF A\nBLUE TILE IS\nNEXT TO A,",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YELLOW TILE,\nTHE WATER WILL\nALSO ZAP YOU!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "PURPLE TILES\nARE SLIPPERY!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU WILL SLIDE\nTO THE NEXT\nTILE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HOWEVER, THE\nSLIPPERY\nSOAP...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SMELLS LIKE\nLEMONS!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHICH PIRANHAS\nDO NOT LIKE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "PURPLE AND\nBLUE ARE OK!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "FINALLY,\nPINK TILES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY DON'T DO\nANYTHING.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "STEP ON THEM\nALL YOU LIKE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HOW WAS THAT!?\nUNDERSTAND???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "repeat": [
    {
      "text": "OKAY...\nI GUESS I'LL\nREPEAT MYSELF...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "RED TILES ARE\nIMPASSABLE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YELLOW TILES ARE\nELECTRIC AND\nDANGEROUS.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BLUE TILES MAKE\nYOU FIGHT A\nMONSTER.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "GREEN TILES ARE\nWATER TILES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ORANGE TILES ARE\nORANGE SCENTED.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IF YOU STEP ON\nORANGE, DON'T STEP\nON GREEN.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BROWN TILES ARE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WAIT!!!\nTHERE ARE NO\nBROWN TILES...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "PURPLE TILES\nSMELL LIKE\nLEMONS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHY DON'T THE\nYELLOW ONES\nSMELL LEMONY?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "UMM...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WAIT!!\nDID I MIX UP\nGREEN AND BLUE!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE BLUE ONES\nARE WATER ONES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "PINK TILES...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I DON'T...\nREMEMBER???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WAIT!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THOSE ONES DON'T\nDO ANYTHING.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "OKAY!\nDO YOU UNDERSTAND\nBETTER NOW!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "ready": [
    {
      "text": "GREAT!!\nTHEN THERE'S ONE\nLAST THING...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THIS PUZZLE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IS ENTIRELY RANDOM\n!!!!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHEN I PULL THIS\nSWITCH, IT WILL\nMAKE A PUZZLE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT HAS NEVER\nBEEN SEEN BEFORE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NOT EVEN I WILL\nKNOW THE SOLUTION!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NYEH HEH HEH!\nGET READY...!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "refuse": [
    {
      "text": "..........",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, YOU KNOW\nWHAT???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HOW ABOUT...\nYOU JUST...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "DO THIS PUZZLE...\nON YOUR OWN...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL LEAVE THE\nINSTRUCTIONS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "JUST READ THEM.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN WHEN YOU\nUNDERSTAND IT...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU CAN THROW\nTHE SWITCH.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND DO IT AT\nYOUR OWN PACE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "GOOD LUCK.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NYEH...\nHEH...\nHEH!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "murderIntro": [
    {
      "text": "HEY!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S THE HUMAN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'RE GONNA\nLOVE THIS\nPUZZLE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT WAS MADE\nBY THE GREAT...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "murderComplaint": [
    {
      "text": "... ARE YOU\nSERIOUS?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SANS!!!\nHELP!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY KEEP WALKING\nTHROUGH MY PUZZLES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEY'RE SUPPOSED\nTO LET ME\nEXPLAIN THEM.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN THREATEN AND\nBAFFLE THEM WITH\nDANGEROUS JAPES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* well, maybe they\n  don't like japes.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE LIKES\nJAPES!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* what about undyne?\n* doesn't she hate\n  puzzles?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHE HATES PUZZLES.\nBUT SHE LOVES\nJAPES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* that makes sense.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "HUMAN!!\nWHAT DO YOU\nTHINK!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "PUZZLES OR JAPES?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "OKAY, THIS IS\nNORMALLY THE\nPART.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHERE YOU EITHER\nAGREE OR DISAGREE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND DEPENDING ON\nYOUR ANSWER.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WE SAY SOMETHING\nGREAT IN RESPONSE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HERE, WHY DON'T\nYOU DO THIS\nPUZZLE YOURSELF.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "note": [
    {
      "text": "* It's illegible chicken-\n  scratch.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "switch": [
    {
      "text": "* (The machine isn't working.)",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "sans": [
    {
      "text": "* actually, that spaghetti\n  from earlier...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* it wasn't too bad for\n  my brother.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* since he started cooking\n  lessons, he's been\n  improving a lot.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i bet if he keeps it\n  up, next year he'll even\n  make something edible.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "sansMurder": [
    {
      "text": "* hey...\n* puzzles might be fun.\n* if you tried them.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
